Scope statement
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Integrase is a design, analysis, and simulation platform that operates on
sequence data. It does not perform genome editing, does not interact with living
organisms, and does not order or produce physical DNA. Physical synthesis and
wet-lab actuation are out of scope and are not capabilities of this software.

Predictions produced by this software are model outputs, not measurements. They
carry calibrated uncertainty, and that uncertainty is part of the result rather
than a caveat attached to it. No output of this system should be treated as a
substitute for experimental validation.

